&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#36b37e&quot;&gt;IDnow is a&lt;strong&gt; leader in digital identity and fraud prevention in Europe&lt;/strong&gt; with a mission to transform trust into the most powerful asset in the digital world, empowering enterprises with &lt;strong&gt;AI-driven, SaaS-based identity solutions that deliver scalable security, adaptive compliance, and real-time fraud prevention&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#36b37e&quot;&gt;Through its broad portfolio of digital identity and fraud prevention solutions, IDnow establishes, maintains and enriches trust throughout the customer journey, ensuring businesses can confidently and securely operate while leveraging digital identity to drive growth, security and scalability. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#36b37e&quot;&gt;The company has &lt;strong&gt;offices in Germany, United Kingdom, Romania and France&lt;/strong&gt;, and is backed by renowned institutional investors, including Corsair Capital and Seventure Partners. Its &lt;strong&gt;portfolio of international clients spans a wide range of end markets&lt;/strong&gt; including financial services, telecommunications, travel &amp;amp; mobility, gaming, and other industries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This position is based in Berlin/Munich, Germany or Rennes, France.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;IDnow is looking for&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Product Owner – Trust Services (f/m/d) &lt;/strong&gt;to own the product direction, backlog and outcomes for a technical product area within IDnow’s Digital Identity and Trust Services portfolio. Working with a dedicated Scrum Team, this role turns customer, operational, regulatory and engineering input into a clear product goal, an ordered backlog and valuable, usable increments that can be released and operated safely.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The most critical aspect of this role is serving as the accountable product interface between the Trust Services domain and Engineering: understanding the system boundaries, APIs, integrations, data flows and non-functional requirements well enough to make sound trade-offs, remove ambiguity and ensure that security, privacy, resilience, auditability and regulatory obligations are built into the product from the beginning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Own the product goal, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;roadmap&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt; and backlog&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;prioritize by&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt; value, risk, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;dependencies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt; and learning; keep decisions transparent.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Drive Scrum outcomes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;: lead refinement, support Planning and Reviews, clarify Sprint Goals, and use delivery metrics to improve flow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Turn needs into buildable requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;: define user/system journeys, domain concepts, business rules, APIs, data states, errors, acceptance &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;criteria&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt; and testable non-functional requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt; – &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;without over-prescribing implementation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Partner on solution quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;: work with Engineering, Architecture, Security, QA and Operations on service boundaries, technical debt, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;scalability, performance, availability, resilience, observability, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;incidents&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt; and operational readiness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Own data, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;integration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt; and lifecycle design&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;: govern identity and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;audit-data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt; flows, access, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;protection&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt; and retention; shape secure, interoperable APIs, including authentication, encryption, versioning, error &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;handling&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt; and documentation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Support releases and continuous improvement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;: define readiness, migrations, cutovers, deprecation, feature &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;flags&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt; and rollback; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;participate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt; in incident reviews and prioritize recurring quality, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt; and operational issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Translate regulation into product decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;: apply eIDAS2, EUDI Wallet, QES, QEAA/EAA, identity-proofing and trust-service requirements with Compliance, Legal, Risk and Trust Services SMEs, tracking adoption, reliability, quality, delivery &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;flow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt; and compliance readiness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Collaborate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; across functions:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;align &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;with Scrum Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, Engineering leadership, Architecture, Security, SRE/Operations, Trust Services, Product, Compliance/Legal/Risk/Data Protection, Commercial and Customer Success, as well as relevant partners, relying parties and standards bodies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Preferred Experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;4+ years of experience in Product Ownership, Technical Product Management, Business Analysis or similar roles in software and service delivery, including direct responsibility for backlog quality and product outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:283,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[720,284],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[0,8]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience working in Scrum or a comparable agile delivery model: ability to define a Product Goal, order a Product Backlog, write clear product backlog items, set acceptance criteria, participate in refinement and reviews, and make timely scope and priority decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:283,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[720,284],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[0,8]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong technical fluency in modern software products and integrations, including REST APIs, JSON/Open API, authentication and authorization, OAuth2/OIDC concepts, webhooks or event streams, data models, service boundaries, API lifecycle and backward-compatible change.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:283,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[720,284],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[0,8]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Demonstrable experience working with regulated software and services, translating regulatory, security, privacy and audit requirements into actionable product requirements and delivery decisions, while balancing compliance, customer value, usability, scalability and time to market.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:283,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[720,284],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[0,8]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Practical understanding of secure software and service delivery: threat and risk thinking, software security, access control, encryption, secrets and key management, vulnerability handling, logging/monitoring, incident response, resilience and software supply-chain considerations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:283,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[720,284],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[0,8]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Practical understanding of data lifecycle and privacy-by-design for identity and trust services, including data minimization, purpose limitation, sensitive evidence, retention and deletion, evidence, archival, data residency, audit trails and access transparency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:283,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[720,284],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[0,8]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ability to work with Engineering on system-level trade-offs without needing to be the implementing engineer, and to distinguish product decisions, architecture decisions, implementation choices, technical debt and operational risk.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:283,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[720,284],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[0,8]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience with service operations and lifecycle management, including release readiness, SLO or service-quality thinking, incident triage, post-incident learning, customer-impact assessment, migration, deprecation and support enablement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:283,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[720,284],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[0,8]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience in regulated industries (e.g., financial services, telecom, public sector, payments, KYC/AML, digital identity, electronic signatures, PKI or trust services) is a strong plus, as is familiarity with eIDAS2, EUDI Wallets, ETSI standards or QTSP operating models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:283,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[720,284],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[0,8]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
